hadiths[23]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2927","Ishaaq ibn Mansoor ne humein riwaayat ki: Abdur-Razzaaq ne humein khabar di: Ja'far ibn Sulaymaan ne humein riwaayat ki: Thaabit ne humein riwaayat ki, unho ne Anas رضي الله عنه se riwaarat ki ke Nabi ﷺ Makkah mein Qaza Umrah (ya'ni Umrah al-Qadaa') ke dauran dakhil hue, aur Abdullah ibn Rawaahah رضي الله عنه unke aage chal rahe the aur padh rahe the:\n\n*\Raaste se hat jao"""","""" aye kuffaar ki aulad"""","""" unke raaste se!*\n*Aaj hum tumhe is (Quran) ke nazool ke mutaliq maarenge"""",""""*\n*Aisa maarna jo sar jagah se alag kar dega"""",""""*\n*Aur saathi ko uske saathi se bekarar kar dega.\""""*\n\nIs par Umar رضي الله عنه ne kaha: \""""Aye Ibn Rawaahah! Rasool Allah ﷺ ki hazrat mein aur Allah ki haram mein tum shairi padh rahe ho?\"""" Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: \""""Usko chhod do"""","""" aye Umar"""","""" kyunki woh un (mushrikeen) par teeron ke tez se bhi zyada tez hai.\""""\n\nAbu Eesaa (Tirmidhi) ne farmaya: \""""Yeh is silsile se hasan saheeh ghareeb hadith hai.\""""\n\nAbdur-Razzaaq ne yeh hadith Ma'mar se"""","""" unho ne Zuhri se"""","""" aur unho ne Anas رضي الله عنه se isi tarah riwaayat ki hai. Aur kuch riwaayaat mein bhi yeh aaya hai ke Nabi ﷺ Umrah al-Qadaa' ke dauran Makkah mein Ka'b ibn Maalik رضي الله عنه ke saath dakhil hue the"""","""" jo unke aage chal rahe the. Muhaddiseen mein se baaz isko zyada saheeh qarar dete hain"""","""" kyunke Abdullah ibn Rawaahah رضي الله"""""""""
"2928","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat farmaya:\n\n\Paighamber-e-Akram (ﷺ) yeh ayat padhte the: 'Anin-nafsu Bin-Nafsi Wal-'Ainu Bil-'Aini'\"" (Surah Al-Baqarah ki aayat se)."""""
"2929","Mu'adh bin Jabal (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat kiya ke Nabi Kareem (ﷺ) padhte the: \Hal Tastati'u Rabbak\"""""""
"2930","Umm Salamah (رضي الله عنها) ne riwayat farmaya: \n\Paighambar-e-Akram (ﷺ) padhte the: 'Innahu 'Amila Ghaira Salih.'\"""""""
"2931","Umm Salamah (رضي الله عنہا) سے روایت ہے: \رسول اللہ (ﷺ) نے یہ آیت تلاوت فرمائی: 'Innahu 'Amalun Ghairu Salih'\"" (11:)"""""
"2932","Muhammad ibn Bashshar ne hamein riwayat sunayi: Yahya ibn Sa'id ne khabar di, Shu'bah se, Qatadah se, Yunus ibn Jubayr se, Muhammad ibn Sa'd ibn Abi Waqqas se, aur unke baap se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah, sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: \Tum mein se kisi ki pet ki pus se bharna uske liye behtar hai"","" isse ki pet ki shayr se bharna.\"" Unhone kaha: Ye ek hasan sahih hadith hai."""""
"2933","Ibn 'Abbas (rzy allh anhma) say rwayt hay kh nby krym (ﷺ) nay \fy aynyn hmyh\"" (swr alkhf، aayt ) tlawt frmaya۔"""""
"2934","Hammām ibn Isḥāq ibn Mūsā al-Anṣārī ne riwāyat kiyā ke 'Abdullāh ibn Wahb ne 'Abd al-Jabbār ibn 'Umar se, aur 'Abd al-Jabbār ne Muḥammad ibn al-Munkadar se, aur Muḥammad ibn al-Munkadar ne Jābir (رضي الله عنه) se riwāyat kiyā ke Rasūlullāh (صلى الله عليه وسلم) ne ek ādmī ko us chhat par sonā manaā farmāyā jis ke ird gird deewār na ho.\n\nAbū 'Īsā (al-Tirmidhī) ne farmāyā: Ye hadīs gharīb hai. Ham is hadīs ko Muḥammad ibn al-Munkadar se Jābir (رضي الله"
"2935","Ibn 'Umar (رضي الله عنهما) ne rivayat farmaya ki unhone Nabi (ﷺ) ke huzoor mein yeh aayat tilawat ki: \Who created you in the weakness (Min Da'f)\"" to Aap (ﷺ) ne farmaya: \""Min Du'f\"" (Ek dosri silsilah) isi tarah ke ma'ani ke saath."""""
"2936","Abdullah bin Mas'ud (rz all anh) say rwayt hay kh rswl allh ﷺ yh aayt prhtay thay: \phr kya kwyy aysa hay jw nsyht qbwl kray؟\"" (swr alqmr، aayt )"""""
"2937","Hazrat Aisha (radiyAllahu anha) rivayet karti hain ke Nabi (ﷺ) tilaawat farmate the: \Furuhun Wa Raihanun Wa Jannatu Na'im\"" (Surah Ar-Rahman"","" ayah 56)."""""
"2938","Alqamah (raziya Allahu anhu) ne bayan farmaya: \Hum Shaam (Syria) aaye aur hum Abu Darda (raziya Allahu anhu) ke paas gaye. Toh unhone poocha: 'Kya tum mein se koi aisa hai jo Abdullah (ibn Mas'ood"""","""" raziya Allahu anhu) ki qiraat ke mutabiq mujh par qiraat kar sakta hai?'\"""" Alqamah ne kaha: \""""Logon ne mujh ki taraf ishara kiya.\"""""""""""""
"2939","Abdullah (رضي الله عنه) ne riwayat ki:\n\n\Rasool Allah (ﷺ) ne mujhse tilawat farmai: 'Beshak Allah hi Rizq dene wala hai.'\"""""""
"2940","Qutaybah ne hamain sunaya, kaha: Abd al-Aziz ibn Muhammad ne hamain sunaya, Suhayl ibn Abi Salih se, unke baap se, Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu anhu) se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya:\n\n\Jab tum zameen-e-saman se guzro"","" to oonton ko zameen ka haq do (ya'ni unhein charaane do). Aur jab tum sukhi ke saal mein safar karo"","" to unke magz ko bachao (ya'ni unhein takleef se bachao). Aur jab tum raat ke liye utro"","" to raaste se door raho"","" kyunke woh jaanwaron ka raasta hai aur raat ko nuqsan dene wale jaanwaron ka ghar hai.\""\n\nUnhon ne kaha: Yeh hasan sahih hadith hai. Is mauzoo par Jabir aur Anas (radi Allahu anhum) se bhi rivaayatain hain."""""
"2941","eik aadmi halqe key beech mein beth gaya, to Huzefa ney kaha : Muhammad Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam key farman key mutabiq wo shakhs maloon hai jo bethey huye logon key halqe (daayre) key beech mein ja kar bethey. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan sahih hai. 2- abu-Mujliz ka naam Laahiq bin Humeed hai."
"2942","koi shakhs unhen yani ( Sahaba ( ko Rasoolullah sey ziyada mehbub na tha kehtey hain : (lekin) wo log aap ko dekh kar (adaban) khadey na hotey they. isliye ke wo log jantey they ke aap Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam isey napasand kartey hain. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees is sanad sey Hasan sahih gharib hai."
"2943","Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) bahar nikley , Abdullah bin Zuber aur ibne Safwan unhen dekh kar (eahatraman) khadey ho gaey. to Muawiya (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha tum dono beth jaao. mainey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ko farmatey huye suna hai : ''jo shakhs ye pasand karey ke log uskey samney baa adab khadey hon to wo apna thikana jahannam mein bana ley.''  Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees Hasan hai, padhi. 2- is bab mein abu-Umama sey bhi riwayat hai, hum sey bayan kiya Hannaad ney wo kehtey hain : hum sey bayan kiya abu-Usaama ney aur abu-Usaama ney Habib bin Shaheed sey Habib bin Shaheed ney abu-Mujliz sey abu-Mujliz ney Muawiya key wastey sey Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi tarah riwayat ki."
"2944","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''paanch cheezen fitrat sey hain : (1) sharmgaah key baal moondnaa. (2) khatna karna. (3) munchhein kutarnaa. (4) baghal key baal ukhednaa. (5) nakhun taraashnaa.'' Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan sahih hai."
"2945","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : ''das padhi. cheezen fitrat sey hain :(1) munchhein kutarnaa. (2) dadhhi badhaanaa. (3) miswak karna. (4) naak mein pani dalna. (5) nakhun kaatnaa. (6) ungliyon key jodon ki pusht dhonaa. (7) baghal key baal ukhednaa. (8) naaf sey nichey key baal moondnaa. (9) pani sey istinja karna. Zakariya (Raavi) kehtey hain ke Musab ney kaha : daswin chiz mein bhool gaya. ho sakta hai ke wo kulli karna ho.''  « انتقاص"
"2946","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney logon key liye muddat mutayyan farma di hai ke har chaalis din key andar nakhun kaat lein. munchhein katarwa lein. aur naaf sey nichey key baal moond lein."
"2947","munchhein katarney , nakhun kaatney, zere-naaf key baal leney , aur baghal key baal ukhaadney ka hamarey liye waqt muqarrar farma diya gaya hai, aur wo ye hai ke hum unhen chaalis din sey ziyada na chhodey rakhen. Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : 1- ye hadees pehli hadees sey ziyada sahih hai, 2- sadqa bin Musa (jo pehli hadees ki sanad mein) muhaddeseen key nazdik Hafiz nahin hain."
"2948","Nabi akram Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam apni munchhein kaat'tey they. aur farmatey they ke khaleelur-Rehman Ibrahim (Alaihissalam) bhi aisa hi kartey they . Imam Tirmizi kehtey hain : ye hadees Hasan gharib hai."
"2949","Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam ney farmaya : '' jisney apni moonchhon key baal na liye (yani unhen nahin kaata) to wo hum mein sey nahin hai ''."
